{"3275210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pionero Capital", "steam_appid": 3275210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NEW CITY, EMPTY POCKETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You skipped town in a hurry, and this city doesn’t care who you used to be. An old friend covers a motel room and points you at the docks. The rest is on you.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/48e538ef36c1dc28b196aba01b6580a5.poster.avif?t=1787886283\" width=840 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/48e538ef36c1dc28b196aba01b6580a5.webm?t=1787886283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/48e538ef36c1dc28b196aba01b6580a5.mp4?t=1787886283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>YOUR FIRST HUSTLE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The port is full of cheap imported goods and people too lazy to drive down and get them. So you do. Pack a van, mark it up, deliver it. Congratulations, you’re an entrepreneur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/f7404cfbaf8ec822be81902c8dd39427.poster.avif?t=1787886283\" width=840 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/f7404cfbaf8ec822be81902c8dd39427.webm?t=1787886283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/f7404cfbaf8ec822be81902c8dd39427.mp4?t=1787886283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>STOP DOING IT YOURSELF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Moving every box by hand has a ceiling, and it’s low. Hire your first employees, put a fleet on the road, and start running the part of the business that runs other people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/ccd967c24808bbdbc6606789f175aa06.poster.avif?t=1787886283\" width=840 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/ccd967c24808bbdbc6606789f175aa06.webm?t=1787886283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/ccd967c24808bbdbc6606789f175aa06.mp4?t=1787886283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/df844fba640242c45ee667589be78cfe.poster.avif?t=1787886283\" width=840 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/df844fba640242c45ee667589be78cfe.webm?t=1787886283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/df844fba640242c45ee667589be78cfe.mp4?t=1787886283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NEW CITY, EMPTY POCKETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You skipped town in a hurry, and this city doesn’t care who you use